ent-ActionHereticMindGate = Mind Gate
    .desc = Tear open the mind of a heathen: mutes, deafens, blinds them and floods their mind with hallucinations and brain damage. The victim laughs, and maddening laughter bursts around them. You suffer as well.
ent-ActionHereticLunarParade = Lunar Parade
    .desc = Sends the parade forward. Anyone pierced by it joins the troupe and suffers hallucinations.
ent-ActionHereticRingleadersRise = Ringleaders Rise
    .desc = Summons illusory copies of you that attack everyone nearby.
